from pathlib import Path
import json
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];m=json.loads((R/'manifest.json').read_text());count=len(m['components']);families=len({a['family'] for a in m['components']})
pages=[('shop','丰收小铺','浅木货架与商品纸签；价格、占地和锁定条件独立显示。'),('storage','农场仓库','库存格、数量滑条、快捷份数与留种提示共用一个详情区。'),('orders','小镇订单','九张夹签纸单，区分可交付、缺料和等待补单。')]
cards=''.join(f'<article class="page-card"><h2>{name}</h2><a href="page-review.html?page={id}"><img class="phone-preview" src="previews/{id}-mobile.png" alt="{name} 400px 手机样板"></a><p>{desc}</p><div class="links"><a href="page-review.html?page={id}&device=phone">手机交互</a><a href="page-review.html?page={id}&device=wide">宽屏交互</a><a href="source/{id}-mobile.svg">可编辑 SVG</a></div></article>' for id,name,desc in pages)
states=[('shop-missing','金币不足'),('shop-locked','未解锁'),('storage-full','仓库已满'),('storage-empty','空仓库'),('orders-missing','订单缺料'),('orders-cooldown','等待补单')]
statecards=''.join(f'<article><h3>{title}</h3><a href="page-review.html?page={id.split("-")[0]}&state={id.split("-")[1]}"><img src="previews/{id}-mobile.png" alt="{title} 手机界面"></a></article>' for id,title in states)
(R/'expansion.html').write_text(f'''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>羊羊牧场 · 小工坊美术扩展</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="source/review.css"><header><div><p class="eyebrow">FARM WORKSHOP / ART KIT 03</p><h1>从小工坊，延伸到整个农场</h1><p>沿用木框、纸签、布棚与浅木箱，让不同操作有共同的农场气质。</p></div><a class="link-button" href="index.html#components">{families} 类 / {count} 个 UI 状态</a></header><div class="page-grid">{cards}</div><section class="strip"><div><h2 style="margin:0 0 5px">自然过渡与清障效果</h2><p>18 个新增连接件 + 1 个薄雾复用层 · 4 组短效果 / 32 帧</p></div><a class="link-button" href="landscape.html">查看地形组合与播放效果 →</a></section><h2>关键状态</h2><p>文案、数量、价格与时间保持独立；按钮不会因为状态变化跳位。</p><div class="state-grid">{statecards}</div><footer><a href="overview.html">生产面板</a> · <a href="index.html#components">全部组件</a> · <a href="EXPANSION.md">交付与接入规范</a> · <a href="manifest.json">九宫格参数</a><p>仅独立美术预览；本轮未接入游戏，也未改变正式存档。</p></footer></html>''')
(R/'page-review.html').write_text('''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>农场操作界面 · 交互样板</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="source/review.css"><header><div><h1>操作界面样板</h1><p>可以点击选择、拖数量滑条和切换必要状态。</p></div><a href="expansion.html">← 扩展总览</a></header><section class="viewer phone"><div class="frame-wrap"><iframe title="农场界面美术样板" src="pages.html?page=shop"></iframe></div><aside><h2>查看不同组合</h2><label for="page">界面</label><select id="page"><option value="shop">丰收小铺</option><option value="storage">农场仓库</option><option value="orders">小镇订单</option></select><label for="device">视口</label><select id="device"><option value="phone">400px 手机</option><option value="wide">宽屏</option></select><label for="state">状态</label><select id="state"></select><p>示例库存、报价、奖励和倒计时用于视觉审阅；正式接入时由游戏提供。</p><p>商店其他分类演示同一套组件，不另造购买逻辑。关闭按钮可关闭再打开样板。</p><a id="source-link" href="source/shop-mobile.svg">可编辑 SVG →</a></aside></section><script type="module" src="source/page-review.js"></script></html>''')
print('Expansion gallery and responsive review wrapper generated.')
